  "body_text": "Jim  Liddle By admin / July 15, 2025 Jim Liddle, with a background in aerospace leadership, joined Clemson University in 2015 following over two decades in the aerospace industry. He held a key position as division President at a division of Transdigm, a manufacturer of highly engineered aerospace components. He holds degrees in Mechanical Engineering and Business Administration. His expertise spans leadership, business strategy, operations, purchasing, quality management, and negotiation. Mr. Liddle played pivotal roles in multiple M&A due diligence processes and successfully relocated an aviation ignition system business to South Carolina. He’s been a member of multiple boards including the Aviation Distributors and Manufacturers Association and the YMCA of Pickens County, SC. He currently serves on the Board of Registration and Elections of Pickens County, SC and the Advocacy and Engagement Board for the Powers College of Business at Clemson University",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<article class=\"post-239 board_members type-board_members status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry ast-article-single\" id=\"post-239\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">Jim  Liddle</h1><div class=\"entry-meta\">By <span class=\"posted-by vcard author\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\"> <a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"https://scupstatefoundation.org/author/admin/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by admin\">\n<span class=\"author-name\" itemprop=\"name\">\n\t\t\t\tadmin\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</span>\n\n\t\t / <span class=\"posted-on\"><span class=\"published\" itemprop=\"datePublished\"> July 15, 2025 </span></span></div>\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\">\n<p>Jim Liddle, with a background in aerospace leadership, joined Clemson University<br/>\nin 2015 following over two decades in the aerospace industry. He held a key<br/>\nposition as division President at a division of Transdigm, a manufacturer of highly<br/>\nengineered aerospace components.</p>\n<p>He holds degrees in Mechanical Engineering and Business Administration. His<br/>\nexpertise spans leadership, business strategy, operations, purchasing, quality<br/>\nmanagement, and negotiation. Mr. Liddle played pivotal roles in multiple M&amp;A due<br/>\ndiligence processes and successfully relocated an aviation ignition system business<br/>\nto South Carolina.</p>\n<p>He’s been a member of multiple boards including the Aviation Distributors and<br/>\nManufacturers Association and the YMCA of Pickens County, SC. He currently serves<br/>\non the Board of Registration and Elections of Pickens County, SC and the Advocacy<br/>\nand Engagement Board for the Powers College of Business at Clemson University</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->\n</div>\n</article><!-- #post-## -->\n </main>",
